1
00:00:44,470 --> 00:00:45,360
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:46,820
[Episode 17]

3
00:00:46,850 --> 00:00:47,390
[Adapted from Migu's novel
“Unsoiled Starlight” ]

4
00:00:47,410 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Writer: Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:00:50,110 --> 00:00:51,240
This is my fault too.

6
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:52,980
I've held you back.

7
00:00:53,360 --> 00:00:55,360
You had to think everything through

8
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:57,920
when you were still so young.

9
00:00:58,280 --> 00:00:59,080
Mom.

10
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:01,320
Don't say that.

11
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:03,320
When I was little,

12
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:05,360
you never saw me as a burden.

13
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:11,560
Neither of us

14
00:01:11,870 --> 00:01:13,560
is a burden to the other.

15
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:19,320
Lan, tell me the truth.

16
00:01:19,700 --> 00:01:21,560
You like Zhuo, don't you?

17
00:01:26,160 --> 00:01:27,800
Then go after him.

18
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:29,450
Lan, remember this.

19
00:01:29,820 --> 00:01:31,200
You're all grown up now.

20
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:32,560
And I'm

21
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:34,600
slowly getting better.

22
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:36,560
We both need

23
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:39,120
to take things one step at a time

24
00:01:39,120 --> 00:01:40,520
and keep moving forward.

25
00:01:58,960 --> 00:01:59,759
You're awake.

26
00:02:00,160 --> 00:02:01,600
How did I fall asleep?

27
00:02:02,080 --> 00:02:03,440
It's been so long

28
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:04,480
since I've seen you

29
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:05,920
sleep this peacefully.

30
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:27,560
Sorry.

31
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:28,640
Did I wake you?

32
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,440
Is there anything

33
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:32,680
I can help with?

34
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:33,560
No.

35
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:34,400
Please don't.

36
00:02:36,079 --> 00:02:37,410
That's not what I meant.

37
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:40,400
Show your mom the bedroom again.

38
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:46,560
You know,

39
00:02:46,930 --> 00:02:47,840
you can't make Zhuo

40
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:49,400
do everything.

41
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:52,200
He drives and cooks.

42
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:54,400
You treat him like a nanny.

43
00:02:54,880 --> 00:02:56,840
He's better at chores.

44
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:59,560
If he wants to, let him.

45
00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:02,200
Then remember,

46
00:03:02,200 --> 00:03:03,560
make it official soon.

47
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:04,480
Mom.

48
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:07,000
Come on.

49
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:24,520
It looks beautiful.

50
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,079
Lan.

51
00:03:42,390 --> 00:03:43,720
Lan, don't go home.

52
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:44,800
- Mom.
- Let him die.

53
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:45,910
Mom, I'm right here.

54
00:03:45,910 --> 00:03:47,560
- Mom.
- Shu Minghai deserved to die.

55
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:48,360
I'm here.

56
00:03:48,380 --> 00:03:49,240
Mom.

57
00:03:49,900 --> 00:03:50,460
Mom.

58
00:03:50,490 --> 00:03:51,320
I'm right here.

59
00:03:51,320 --> 00:03:52,000
Look at me.

60
00:03:52,210 --> 00:03:53,200
He deserved to die.

61
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:53,680
Mom.

62
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:56,320
- Why do they get to live it up abroad?
- Mom, calm down.

63
00:03:56,320 --> 00:03:57,040
How is that fair?

64
00:03:57,040 --> 00:03:59,960
- While we hide and pay off his debts?
- Mom.

65
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:01,320
Let go of me.

66
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:02,920
Are you okay?

67
00:04:04,540 --> 00:04:05,600
What are you doing?

68
00:04:05,670 --> 00:04:06,720
Why?

69
00:04:07,820 --> 00:04:09,280
How is that fair?

70
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:12,560
Let him die.

71
00:04:13,230 --> 00:04:14,640
Auntie... Auntie.

72
00:04:14,640 --> 00:04:16,399
- Mom.
- Why do they get to live it up?

73
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:17,800
I'm here. I'm right here.

74
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:19,480
It's all right. Take it easy.

75
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:20,630
Lan and I are right here.

76
00:04:20,630 --> 00:04:22,029
Everything will be okay.

77
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:28,080
Zhuo.

78
00:04:28,880 --> 00:04:30,520
Please forgive me.

79
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:32,400
I'm so sorry, Zhuo.

80
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:33,970
This is all my fault.

81
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:37,030
I shouldn't have kept asking Lan
to take me home.

82
00:04:37,030 --> 00:04:38,100
This is all my fault.

83
00:04:38,100 --> 00:04:39,430
It's okay. You're fine.

84
00:04:41,570 --> 00:04:42,770
Don't worry about it.

85
00:04:43,200 --> 00:04:44,530
Lan and I are right here.

86
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:46,240
No one will ever hurt you again.

87
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:47,760
Things will get better.

88
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:51,720
Does it hurt?

89
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:53,050
It's okay. Don't worry.

90
00:05:05,340 --> 00:05:06,200
All done.

91
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:14,440
I'm sorry.

92
00:05:15,760 --> 00:05:17,160
Why are you apologizing?

93
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:18,680
I--

94
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:20,900
I'm the one who should apologize.

95
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:21,840
When things first went wrong

96
00:05:21,840 --> 00:05:23,160
between you and Wen Jian,

97
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,490
I should've stepped in.

98
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:26,760
But I waited too long.

99
00:05:30,950 --> 00:05:31,760
I'm sorry.

100
00:05:34,159 --> 00:05:36,040
Don't you want to ask me anything?

101
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:38,320
Like why

102
00:05:38,790 --> 00:05:40,050
I hate Wen Jian so much.

103
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:42,120
Or why my mom is like this.

104
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:45,159
- Why don't you ask?
- Because that's your past.

105
00:05:46,180 --> 00:05:47,640
Tell me when you're ready.

106
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:50,620
Or never tell me. That's your choice.

107
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:53,080
I can wait.

108
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:55,480
Besides,

109
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:56,560
I don't care about

110
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:59,120
the secrets that still hurt.

111
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:01,960
What I care about is you.

112
00:06:08,080 --> 00:06:09,340
Have you thought about

113
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:11,450
what you'd be taking on?

114
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:13,760
And do you even know

115
00:06:14,310 --> 00:06:15,280
what you mean to me

116
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:16,920
right now?

117
00:06:18,760 --> 00:06:20,090
For now, I'm Zhuo Yu'an.

118
00:06:20,580 --> 00:06:22,580
Tomorrow, I might be all swollen up.

119
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:31,080
Mom.

120
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,159
Why are you still up?

121
00:06:38,159 --> 00:06:38,720
Lan.

122
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:40,480
I did something awful

123
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:42,280
back there, right?

124
00:06:44,270 --> 00:06:44,880
It's okay.

125
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:45,600
Mom.

126
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:46,700
It's all behind us now.

127
00:06:46,700 --> 00:06:47,900
It wasn't your fault.

128
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:50,020
No, some things never go away.

129
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:51,440
They leave

130
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:52,880
scars.

131
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,440
They may look healed,

132
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:56,210
but the pain is still there.

133
00:06:57,330 --> 00:06:58,280
In my whole life,

134
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:00,840
you're the one I've let down most.

135
00:07:02,640 --> 00:07:04,240
I was wrong to trust your dad.

136
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:08,560
Zhuo.

137
00:07:10,190 --> 00:07:10,840
Auntie.

138
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:11,900
I'm listening.

139
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:14,160
I'm sick.

140
00:07:14,740 --> 00:07:15,860
Sometimes my mind is clear.

141
00:07:15,860 --> 00:07:16,990
Sometimes it isn't.

142
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:19,240
But there's one thing

143
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:21,320
I know for certain right now.

144
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:23,160
And I need to tell you.

145
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:26,920
I may

146
00:07:28,080 --> 00:07:29,640
not have much time left

147
00:07:30,520 --> 00:07:31,980
when I'm this clearheaded

148
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:33,730
to stay by Lan's side

149
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:35,040
and protect her.

150
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:38,600
My last wish

151
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:40,720
in this life

152
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:43,640
is to see Lan

153
00:07:43,840 --> 00:07:45,080
find someone

154
00:07:45,640 --> 00:07:48,040
who will always cherish her.

155
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:49,720
Auntie.

156
00:07:50,850 --> 00:07:51,780
You have my word.

157
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:54,530
As long as Tinglan needs me,

158
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:56,760
and as long as I can help,

159
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:59,520
I'll always stay by her side.

160
00:08:01,280 --> 00:08:03,280
I'll make her feel safe.

161
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:06,840
Tinglan.

162
00:08:08,560 --> 00:08:09,560
That's my promise

163
00:08:11,590 --> 00:08:12,320
to you

164
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:14,160
and to your mother.

165
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:18,840
Will you give me that chance?

166
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:27,850
Not a chance to be your husband.

167
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:29,720
Just a chance

168
00:08:30,480 --> 00:08:32,679
to keep those promises.

169
00:08:33,640 --> 00:08:34,440
I'm sorry.

170
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:37,299
My head is a mess right now.

171
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:39,200
I need some time.

172
00:08:41,159 --> 00:08:41,960
I'm sorry.

173
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:48,160
Okay.

174
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:50,240
I'll leave you two to talk.

175
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:51,160
I'll get going.

176
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:01,560
Lan.

177
00:09:03,560 --> 00:09:05,200
I know what you're afraid of.

178
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:07,520
I'm sick.

179
00:09:07,680 --> 00:09:08,760
I'm not stupid.

180
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:11,680
You can't fake your first instinct.

181
00:09:12,330 --> 00:09:13,840
I hit him,

182
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:16,000
but his first thought was to calm me

183
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:17,660
so I wouldn't hurt myself.

184
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:20,000
And the way he looks at you--

185
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:22,240
Mom.

186
00:09:22,760 --> 00:09:23,960
Have you ever thought

187
00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:25,490
that people can change?

188
00:09:25,650 --> 00:09:26,910
Just like Shu Minghai.

189
00:09:27,180 --> 00:09:27,530
He--

190
00:09:27,560 --> 00:09:29,290
I know what you're going to say.

191
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:31,610
You need to see who he really is.

192
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:32,640
Besides,

193
00:09:33,110 --> 00:09:35,440
This isn't about giving Zhuo Yu'an
a chance.

194
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:36,640
It's about giving my daughter

195
00:09:36,640 --> 00:09:38,120
a chance to be happy.

196
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:42,600
While I can still think clearly,

197
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:44,280
I want to see

198
00:09:44,280 --> 00:09:45,120
someone

199
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:46,520
who can take my place,

200
00:09:46,800 --> 00:09:47,840
protect you,

201
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:49,480
and make you happy.

202
00:09:53,880 --> 00:09:55,120
I'm so scared.

203
00:09:55,880 --> 00:09:56,600
I'm afraid

204
00:09:57,160 --> 00:09:57,920
that one day,

205
00:09:58,520 --> 00:10:00,320
I can't watch over you anymore.

206
00:10:00,800 --> 00:10:01,240
Mom.

207
00:10:01,800 --> 00:10:02,800
You'll be okay.

208
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,080
We'll both be okay.

209
00:10:05,150 --> 00:10:06,480
I'll do everything I can

210
00:10:06,760 --> 00:10:07,960
to be happy for you.

211
00:10:19,330 --> 00:10:24,620
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

212
00:10:21,560 --> 00:10:22,200
Yu'an.

213
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:32,000
I asked you here

214
00:10:32,390 --> 00:10:34,080
to confirm something important.

215
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:34,760
Yu'an.

216
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:36,600
Before that,

217
00:10:36,760 --> 00:10:38,310
I need to tell you something.

218
00:10:38,310 --> 00:10:40,020
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

219
00:10:38,760 --> 00:10:39,960
I spoke with Wang Yan.

220
00:10:40,400 --> 00:10:41,640
We both agree

221
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:43,880
that staying in the same setting

222
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:45,920
for too long limits our thinking.

223
00:10:45,920 --> 00:10:46,920
So the two of us

224
00:10:48,040 --> 00:10:49,640
should rotate overseas.

225
00:10:50,260 --> 00:10:51,280
Are you saying

226
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:54,200
you and Wang Yan will switch roles?

227
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:56,320
You'll come back,

228
00:10:56,400 --> 00:10:57,660
and he'll go overseas?

229
00:10:57,760 --> 00:10:58,510
Yes.

230
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:00,440
Once you're back,

231
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:01,640
will you leave again?

232
00:11:03,680 --> 00:11:04,720
You won't.

233
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:07,600
And now the two of you

234
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:08,850
are simply informing me.

235
00:11:08,850 --> 00:11:11,400
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

236
00:11:09,680 --> 00:11:10,320
Yu'an.

237
00:11:11,680 --> 00:11:13,120
Since Zhuoyuan Technology

238
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:14,950
will focus on the domestic market,

239
00:11:14,950 --> 00:11:15,640
then

240
00:11:15,880 --> 00:11:16,760
the R&D team

241
00:11:17,560 --> 00:11:19,020
should also be based here.

242
00:11:19,280 --> 00:11:20,960
I can set the R&D direction

243
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:22,090
and manage the team.

244
00:11:22,340 --> 00:11:24,400
I'm a better fit for the role here.

245
00:11:25,060 --> 00:11:26,840
Besides, we're partners.

246
00:11:27,450 --> 00:11:28,720
We have the right

247
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:30,400
to choose the best strategy.

248
00:11:30,880 --> 00:11:32,080
You said it yourself.

249
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:33,440
We're partners.

250
00:11:34,280 --> 00:11:35,280
Then who makes

251
00:11:35,280 --> 00:11:36,800
the final decisions here?

252
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:41,680
Yu'an.

253
00:11:41,680 --> 00:11:42,480
Wang Yan.

254
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:44,480
Give us a minute.

255
00:11:44,930 --> 00:11:45,840
Jane and I

256
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:47,480
need to talk.

257
00:11:54,710 --> 00:11:56,750
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

258
00:12:01,220 --> 00:12:04,270
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

259
00:12:06,020 --> 00:12:06,640
Yu'an.

260
00:12:07,680 --> 00:12:08,640
I'm being serious

261
00:12:08,640 --> 00:12:10,400
about this.

262
00:12:10,880 --> 00:12:13,000
This isn't about what I want.

263
00:12:13,600 --> 00:12:14,520
It's about what's best

264
00:12:14,520 --> 00:12:16,240
for the company's future.

265
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:18,520
Wen Jian.

266
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:21,400
Some lines you just don't cross.

267
00:12:21,520 --> 00:12:23,040
Ever.

268
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:26,800
You know exactly what you did.

269
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:29,440
Sending you overseas

270
00:12:29,460 --> 00:12:30,960
is a business decision.

271
00:12:31,640 --> 00:12:33,120
As your friend,

272
00:12:34,800 --> 00:12:36,600
consider this my final warning.

273
00:12:39,060 --> 00:12:44,710
[Zhuoyuan Technology]
